{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.ProductionChainBondProduct","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.ProductionChainBondProduct","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.InteriorMarkovOfBraidedTower","lean:module:QOU.Mass.StrandLayoutForcesChain"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ProductionChainBondProduct.tr_productionChain_braided","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ProductionChainBondProduct.tr_productionChain_braided","kind":"theorem","line":173,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ProductionChainBondProduct.lean#L173-L189","doc":"**The derived form: the bond product from the braid relations alone.**\n\nNo `InteriorMarkov` hypothesis — `interiorMarkov_of_braided` discharges it on\nevery `BraidedTower`, so the input is exactly the three defining relations of\n`H_n(q)` (quadratic, braid, far commutation) together with the strand-window\nmemberships that `StrandLayoutForcesChain` establishes for the production word.\n\n🛑 The bond scalars `d` remain arbitrary: this derives the *factorisation*, not\nthe identification of the production letters. See the module docstring. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ProductionChainBondProduct.tr_productionChain","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ProductionChainBondProduct.tr_productionChain","kind":"theorem","line":152,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ProductionChainBondProduct.lean#L152-L169","doc":"**The bond product for the production layout.**\n\nFor a tower with the interior-bond property, the trace of the production atom\nword factorises as the product of `z + d` over its bonds times the trace of the\nsame word with every bond letter deleted. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ProductionChainBondProduct.prod_chainFrom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ProductionChainBondProduct.prod_chainFrom","kind":"theorem","line":138,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ProductionChainBondProduct.lean#L138-L150","doc":"The bond-scalar product of the chain, as an ordinary indexed product. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ProductionChainBondProduct.chainOK_chainFrom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ProductionChainBondProduct.chainOK_chainFrom","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ProductionChainBondProduct.lean#L119-L136","doc":"**`ChainOK` holds for the production layout**, by the level arithmetic of the\nstrand windows and nothing else. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ProductionChainBondProduct.headBond_chainFrom_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ProductionChainBondProduct.headBond_chainFrom_succ","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ProductionChainBondProduct.lean#L116-L117","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ProductionChainBondProduct.chainFrom_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ProductionChainBondProduct.chainFrom_succ","kind":"theorem","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ProductionChainBondProduct.lean#L111-L113","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ProductionChainBondProduct.chainFrom_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ProductionChainBondProduct.chainFrom_zero","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ProductionChainBondProduct.lean#L107-L108","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.ProductionChainBondProduct.chainFrom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.ProductionChainBondProduct.chainFrom","kind":"def","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/ProductionChainBondProduct.lean#L96-L104","doc":"**The production chain.** `chainFrom blk d start n` lists `n` bonds starting\nat nucleon `start`: bond `j` is the generator `σ_{3(start+j)+2}` carrying the\nscalar `d (start+j)`, followed by nucleon block `blk (start+j+1)`.\n\nThe indices are `StrandLayoutForcesChain`'s: the bridge between nucleons `k` and\n`k+1` is `σ_{3k+2}`, and no other single generator joins two nucleons. ","signatureChunk":0}]}